Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Replace recording rotation vocabulary with cycle slots

Name completion-gated reusable positions as CycleSlot, count them with RecordingSlotCount, and distinguish slot ordinals from monotonic recording ordinals. Preserve Rotation for angular and quaternion mechanisms. Update the naming authority and construction instructions; generated indexes remain for the local construction step.
